## One record
investigation.json on the investigation page is the only fact store. 01.md, 03.md, 08.md, 05.NN.md, and 06.NN.md are regenerated projections. Show/index is computed and not stored. There is no editable status field. Draft, pending review, held/followup, accepted-without-terminal, and explicit completion are flags derived in STATE-MAP.md.

A release, claim, or review line is a supplied statement. The tool stores it and does not treat it as authority. A receipt is custody. Sitting in 0700 does not release a draft.

## Interface gaps
These stay in this note. The shared interface files were not edited.

G1. The shared contract requires a digest bound to the request, the binding, and the selected bytes, and it does not name the algorithm. Local algorithm: colab-package-digest/1 in CONTRACT.md.

G2. The shared contract does not define section-id syntax. A target kind id matches a whole line `section-id: VALUE`. No fuzzy heading match.

G3. Package 06.NN.md is supplied purpose and reason. Findings are a later caller-supplied list. Prose is not parsed into findings.

G4. No sub-band inside 0700–0799 is declared. 0700 is the door and is not an investigation. 0701–0799 are members when the caller selects one. 0710 is not a special door. A free integer is not allocated.

G5. source.commit is a stored 40-hex label. The sha256 binds the snapshot bytes. This tool does not call Git and does not follow HEAD.

G6. binding-example.json names 0701.desk-state. That page is an example, not an investigation and not a release. It is not created here.

G7. Law 0007 keeps face 07 absent. Law 0040 reserves kernel pages 0000–0009 for notes that are not about those pages. This tool creates neither.

## Custody
The return pointer launches the pinned return_inspect.py and return_capture.py verify after a byte pin. Origin must be the investigation book, page, and pass. A 0508 subject member or a 0510 implementation member does not bind by name or title. Two non-retrospective matches require an explicit member. A retrospective capture stays secondary. The pass page stores the member pointer. The return body stays in 0100.

## Not done here
No model, no network Colab, no live-book investigation, no edit to 00.live, app entry, registry, law, 0411, 0700, or the pinned helpers. Subject notes are proposals under the investigation. They are not written onto the subject page.

## Disposition of these gaps
G1–G7 are recorded for Prime. They are not applied as silent edits to the shared contract or to law. The local digest and the section-id line are the rules this adapter enforces until Prime aligns them with the reviewed 0510 output.

